      "releaseNotes": "Version 4.4 Improves Functionality. Version 4.0 - Added 4 New much requested features.. Top 50 City Debt and Unfunded Liabilities.. Famous Fortunes of some of America's most accomplished pioneers in Today's Dollars.. Most Expensive American Natural Disasters in Today's Dollars.. and Relevant Stats, a compilation of Real-Time Info that is sure to surprise.. All these New features bring the App to well over 3000 Live Data fields to keep you up to date on the American Financial System....In (Version 3.5) 600 Live Data fields were added. A New Page showing Current Income and Increase for 200 of the Highest Paid Occupations. An Inflation Index that shows the Real-Time increase in prices for many consumer goods over the last 100 years. A New category featuring Totals and Percentages of Waste by various Government Agencies. A New Feature called Military Hardware that shows the cost of US Planes, Ships and Vehicles through history and their current price in inflation adjusted dollars",
